#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/virtual-cam.rst:48
msgid ""
"The virtual-cam directory contains sample images that will be fed into the "
"virtual camera frame buffer. The images need to be in PPM format and "
"numbered \"IMGxxxxx.PPM\" where the x's represent the frame number. The "
"virtual-cam hal will read in images each time cc3_load_frame() is called in "
"increasing order starting from \"IMG00000.PPM\". Once no more images are "
"available, the virtual-hal will panic and stop. These images can be created "
"using the ppm-grab project. By default, the **ppm-grab project** stores raw,"
" high resolution, uncompressed images in the correct format to be used by "
"the virtual-cam hal."
msgstr ""
"Direktori virtual-cam berisi gambar contoh yang akan diumpankan ke frame "
"buffer kamera virtual. Gambar harus dalam format PPM dan diberi nomor "
"\"IMGxxxxx.PPM\" di mana x mewakili nomor frame. Hal virtual-cam akan "
"membaca gambar setiap kali cc3_load_frame() dipanggil dalam urutan meningkat"
" mulai dari \"IMG00000.PPM\". Setelah tidak ada lagi gambar yang tersedia, "
"virtual-hal akan panik dan berhenti. Gambar-gambar ini dapat dibuat "
"menggunakan proyek ppm-grab. Secara default, **proyek ppm-grab** menyimpan "
"gambar mentah, resolusi tinggi, tidak terkompresi dalam format yang benar "
"untuk digunakan oleh hal virtual-cam."

